# UXC: unsupported 1366x768 gives -6 until the host goes back to 1080p.
chip ux
board beta
file /etc/kvm/hdmi_mode 0
file /kvmapp/kvm/state 0\n
file /kvmapp/kvm/width 1920\n
file /kvmapp/kvm/height 1080\n
vidbg auto
src 1920 1080
call init
at 1100
call mjpeg 1920 1080 80 every 100 until 2000
at 2000
src 1366 768
int fall
at 2100
call mjpeg 1920 1080 80 every 100 until 5000
at 5000
src 1920 1080
int fall
at 5100
call mjpeg 1920 1080 80 every 100 until 8000
at 8000
end
